+# {{TENANT_NAME}}
+
+> An [OlonJS](https://olon.js.org) Sovereign Tenant — a website that is natively readable and operable by AI agents.
+
+## What this is
+
+This project is built with [OlonJS](https://olon.js.org), the AI-native content infrastructure for the agentic web. Every page in this site ships **two views of the same content**:
+
+- A human view at `/{slug}` — your usual React UI.
+- A machine view at `/{slug}.json` — a typed JSON contract, validated with Zod, ready for any MCP-aware agent.
+
+The schema is the API. No scraping. No guesswork. One deterministic surface.
+
+## Run it
+
+```bash
+npm run dev
+```
+
+Then open both views of the same page:
+
+```bash
+# Human view
+open http://localhost:5173/
+
+# Agent view — same page, typed contract
+curl http://localhost:5173/home.json
+```
+
+## Edit your first page
+
+Pages live in `src/data/pages/`. Each page is a typed object defining its `sections`. The runtime renders the React UI and serves the JSON sidecar from the same source.
+
+```ts
+// src/data/pages/home.ts (sketch)
+export default {
+  id: 'home-page',
+  slug: 'home',
+  meta: { title: 'Home', description: '…' },
+  sections: [
+    { id: 'hero-1', type: 'hero', data: { /* … */ } },
+  ],
+}
+```
+
+Add a new file in `src/data/pages/` and the route plus its `.json` sidecar appear automatically.
+
+## Project scripts
+
+- `npm run dev` — start the dev server (Vite + HMR).
+- `npm run build` — type-check and build the production bundle.
+- `npm run preview` — preview the production build locally.
+- `npm run verify:webmcp` — sanity-check the WebMCP surface.
+
+## Where to go next
+
+- **[Quickstart →](https://github.com/olonjs/npm-jpcore/blob/main/README.md)** — the canonical OlonJS overview.
+- **[Architecture →](https://github.com/olonjs/npm-jpcore/blob/main/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md)** — how the runtime, CLI, and DNA fit together.
+- **[Canonical schemas →](https://github.com/olonjs/npm-jpcore/blob/main/docs/canonical-schemas-howto.md)** — how to define your own section types.
+- **[WebMCP →](https://github.com/olonjs/npm-jpcore/blob/main/docs/webmcp.md)** — the browser API for agent-driven mutations.
+
+## Stack
+
+- React 19 + TypeScript + Vite 6
+- Tailwind CSS v4
+- Zod for contract validation
+- `@olonjs/core` runtime engine
+
+## Help and feedback
+
+- Issues: [github.com/olonjs/npm-jpcore/issues](https://github.com/olonjs/npm-jpcore/issues)
+- Site: [olon.js.org](https://olon.js.org)
+
+---
+
+Built with OlonJS. MIT-licensed. Sovereign by design.
