+# @olonjs/cli
+
+> The Sovereign CLI Engine for [OlonJS](https://olon.js.org). Scaffolds AI-native tenants in one command.
+
+[![npm version](https://img.shields.io/npm/v/@olonjs/cli?color=blue&style=flat-square)](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@olonjs/cli)
+[![license](https://img.shields.io/badge/license-MIT-green?style=flat-square)](https://github.com/olonjs/npm-jpcore/blob/main/LICENSE)
+
+`@olonjs/cli` is the primary entry point for developers building on [OlonJS](https://olon.js.org), the AI-native content infrastructure where every page is a typed JSON contract for both humans and AI agents.
+
+## Quickstart
+
+```bash
+npx @olonjs/cli new tenant my-agentic-site --template alpha
+cd my-agentic-site
+npm run dev
+```
+
+Then verify both surfaces:
+
+```bash
+curl http://localhost:5173/         # human view (HTML)
+curl http://localhost:5173/home.json # agent view (typed JSON contract)
+```
+
+## Commands
+
+| Command | Purpose |
+|---|---|
+| `olonjs new tenant <name> [--template alpha]` | Scaffold a new OlonJS tenant from a DNA template. |
+| `olonjs init-mcp` | Configure the local MCP server in your editor (Cursor, Cline, etc.). |
+
+Templates are projected deterministically from the canonical DNA. The CLI wipes Vite's default boilerplate, injects the Sovereign infrastructure, installs dependencies, and leaves you with a working dev server.
+
+## Available templates
+
+- `alpha` (default) — the reference DNA template, generated from `apps/tenant-alpha` in the [OlonJS monorepo](https://github.com/olonjs/npm-jpcore).
+
+## Requirements
+
+- Node.js 18+
+- npm 9+ (the CLI shells out to `npm create vite@latest` during scaffolding)
+
+## Documentation
+
+- [CLI reference](https://github.com/olonjs/npm-jpcore/blob/main/docs/CLI.md)
+- [Templates governance](https://github.com/olonjs/npm-jpcore/blob/main/docs/TEMPLATES.md)
+- [Architecture](https://github.com/olonjs/npm-jpcore/blob/main/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md)
+
+## License
+
+MIT © OlonJS Team.
+
+— Learn more at [olon.js.org](https://olon.js.org).
