+# @olonjs/stack
+
+> Dependency manifest for [OlonJS](https://olon.js.org) tenants — single source of truth for stack versions.
+
+[![npm version](https://img.shields.io/npm/v/@olonjs/stack?color=blue&style=flat-square)](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@olonjs/stack)
+[![license](https://img.shields.io/badge/license-MIT-green?style=flat-square)](https://github.com/olonjs/npm-jpcore/blob/main/LICENSE)
+
+`@olonjs/stack` pins the canonical versions of the runtime, build, and peer dependencies used by every OlonJS tenant. The CLI and the core runtime read from this manifest so that scaffolds, releases, and tenants stay in lockstep.
